warning[unused_variable]: unused variable `leftover`
  --> tests/lint/unused_variable/bad.jai:8:5
   |
 8 |     leftover := 5;
   |     ^^^^^^^^
   |
help: remove it
   |
 8 -     leftover := 5;
   |
   = note: `unused_variable` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_variable]: unused variable `noted`
  --> tests/lint/unused_variable/bad.jai:9:5
   |
 9 |     noted := 7; // the comment stays
   |     ^^^^^
   |
help: remove it
   |
 9 ~     // the comment stays
   |
   = note: `unused_variable` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_variable]: unused variable `b`
  --> tests/lint/unused_variable/bad.jai:10:8
   |
10 |     a, b := 1, 2;
   |        ^
   |
help: name it `_` if the value is not needed
   |
10 ~     a, _ := 1, 2;
   |
   = note: `unused_variable` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_variable]: unused variable `found`
  --> tests/lint/unused_variable/bad.jai:13:12
   |
13 |     value, found := lookup("key");
   |            ^^^^^
   |
help: leave it out: later results of a call can be dropped
   |
13 ~     value := lookup("key");
   |
   = note: `unused_variable` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_variable]: unused variable `second`
  --> tests/lint/unused_variable/bad.jai:16:12
   |
16 |     first, second: string;
   |            ^^^^^^
   |
help: remove it from the declaration
   |
16 ~     first: string;
   |
   = note: `unused_variable` is `warn` by default
